  "prefLabel": "Pda 601.04 Recreational-use pier berthing area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 601.04 “Recreational-use pier berthing area” means the area(s) of a recreational-use pier located at Rye Harbor or Hampton Harbor designated by the division director or designee for the berthing of vessels.\n\nSource. #10441, eff 11-1-13 ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
